Homepage: https://github.com/minhngoc2512/status-bar
Description: Claude Code, weather and crypto indicators for the top bar
 Three GTK tray indicators in one process:
 .
  * Claude Code session status, fed by Claude Code hooks (working, waiting for
    confirmation, background task, error, idle) across every open session.
  * Current weather from Open-Meteo, located either by IP or by a place picked
    in Settings.
  * Crypto prices and 24h change from Binance's public API.
 .
 Each indicator can be switched off independently from a GTK settings window.
 No API keys and no third-party Python packages are required.
